Source: eitaas-linux
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: EITaaS-Linux contributors <sjtrotter@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, pybuild-plugin-pyproject, python3-all, python3-setuptools, python3-wheel
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/sjtrotter/EITaaS-Linux

Package: eitaas-linux
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, opensc, pcscd, pcsc-tools, libccid, libpcsclite1, bash-completion
Recommends: eitaas-remmina
Suggests: zsh
Description: community Linux helper for EITaaS Azure Virtual Desktop
 Provides read-only diagnostics, protected RDPW profile handling, smart-card
 checks, and a validated wrapper around the bundled one-shot eitaas-remmina
 client, which is required for connections.

Package: eitaas-linux-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, eitaas-linux (= ${binary:Version}), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: eitaas-remmina
Description: graphical readiness/profile/connect helper for EITaaS AVD
 Optional GTK 4 / Libadwaita front end for the eitaas command-line helper.
 It shows readiness diagnostics, inspects RDPW profiles, and launches the
 bundled one-shot eitaas-remmina client for connections. The desktop entry,
 MIME association for .rdpw profiles, icons, and GTK dependencies live in this
 package so that CLI-only installations stay lean.
